# A new campaign to its first battle and through it: the lance editor as in
# lance_editor.keys, the story's screens, then the battle's messages answered
# with their first choice while the battle runs between them. In the battle
# each wait is still:2000, 2000 polls without a battle step (a message is up),
# so every key lands at the same point of the battle on any machine.
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000
Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300
Return idle:9000 Return idle:6000                   # leave the editor; the story
Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000  # its screens, one key each
Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000 Return            # the battle begins
still:2000 @snap:battle                             # its first message up
Return still:2000 @snap:message1                    # each message's first choice,
Return still:2000 @snap:message2                    # then the battle runs on
Return still:2000 @snap:message3
Return still:2000 @snap:message4
Return still:2000 @snap:after                       # the battle over: the story
